text="Types">Types</fr:title><fr:date><fr:year>2024</fr:year><fr:month>6</fr:month><fr:day>3</fr:day></fr:date><fr:date><fr:year>2024</fr:year><fr:month>8</fr:month><fr:day>21</fr:day></fr:date><fr:authors /></fr:frontmatter><fr:mainmatter><fr:p>The types have the structure of the objects of an elementary topos,
            ie a collection of atomic types closed under <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[1,×,→,Ω]]></fr:tex>.</fr:p></fr:mainmatter><fr:backmatter /></fr:tree><fr:tree
