root="false"
xmlns:fr="http://www.jonmsterling.com/jms-005P.xml"><fr:frontmatter><fr:anchor>436</fr:anchor><fr:addr
type="machine">#274</fr:addr><fr:route>unstable-274.xml</fr:route><fr:title
text="Terms">Terms</fr:title><fr:date><fr:year>2024</fr:year><fr:month>6</fr:month><fr:day>3</fr:day></fr:date><fr:date><fr:year>2024</fr:year><fr:month>8</fr:month><fr:day>21</fr:day></fr:date><fr:authors /></fr:frontmatter><fr:mainmatter><fr:p>"The [language] is sorted…. We inductively define terms and their sorts:
            <fr:ul><fr:li>(LT1) Each sort <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[A]]></fr:tex> has a list of <fr:em>variables over <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[A]]></fr:tex></fr:em>,
                    <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[x₁, x₂, x₃…]]></fr:tex>. Every variable over <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[A]]></fr:tex> is a term of sort
                    <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[A]]></fr:tex>.</fr:li>
                <fr:li>(LT2) For any [function symbol <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[f : A→B]]></fr:tex>] and term <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[s]]></fr:tex> [of] sort
                    <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[A]]></fr:tex>, <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[f s]]></fr:tex> is a term of sort <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[B]]></fr:tex>. [Constant symbols <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[c :                     1→A]]></fr:tex> are also] a term of sort <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[A]]></fr:tex>…. We write <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[!]]></fr:tex> as a
                    constant [of sort <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[1]]></fr:tex>].</fr:li>
                <fr:li>(LT3) For every term <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[s₁]]></fr:tex> of sort <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[A]]></fr:tex> and <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[s₂]]></fr:tex> of sort <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[B]]></fr:tex>,
                    there is a term <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[⟨s₁,s₂⟩]]></fr:tex> of sort <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[A×B]]></fr:tex>.</fr:li>
                <fr:li>(LT4) For every term <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[s]]></fr:tex> of sort <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[B]]></fr:tex> and variable <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[y]]></fr:tex> of
                    sort <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[A]]></fr:tex>, there is a term <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[λy. s]]></fr:tex> of sort <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[Bᴬ]]></fr:tex>.</fr:li></fr:ul>"
            <fr:ul><fr:li>"The <fr:em>extension</fr:em> of <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[ϕ]]></fr:tex> over a list of variables
                    <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[\overline {x}]]></fr:tex> is the sub-object <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[\{\overline {x} | ϕ\}]]></fr:tex>
                    of <fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[A₁×A₂×…Aₙ]]></fr:tex> classified by [<fr:tex
display="inline"><![CDATA[ϕ]]></fr:tex>]."</fr:li></fr:ul></fr:p></fr:mainmatter><fr:backmatter /></fr:tree><fr:tree
