text="Finite-type intuitionistic predicate logic">Finite-type intuitionistic predicate logic</fr:title><fr:date><fr:year>2024</fr:year><fr:month>6</fr:month><fr:day>3</fr:day></fr:date><fr:date><fr:year>2024</fr:year><fr:month>8</fr:month><fr:day>21</fr:day></fr:date><fr:authors /></fr:frontmatter><fr:mainmatter><fr:p>There is some (a posteriori insignificant) variation in the presentation of
    the syntax, thus following through with some input from <fr:link
type="local"
href="ericgio.xml"
addr="ericgio"
title="Eric Giovannini">Eric Giovannini</fr:link>, we
